[
  {
    "id": "lia_opening_book_entry_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "opening_book_entry",
    "text": "这一步很熟。你走进了准备好的路。",
    "file": "lia_opening_book_entry_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_opening_book_entry_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "opening_book_entry",
    "text": "开局走得漂亮，至少前几页没有乱。",
    "file": "lia_opening_book_entry_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_opening_book_entry_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "opening_book_entry",
    "text": "熟悉的结构。真正的较量还在后面。",
    "file": "lia_opening_book_entry_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_opening_book_entry_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "opening_book_entry",
    "text": "第一段走得干净，别急着以为整盘都懂了。",
    "file": "lia_opening_book_entry_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_opening_book_exit_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "opening_book_exit",
    "text": "库里的答案到这里，接下来才轮到你思考。",
    "file": "lia_opening_book_exit_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_opening_book_exit_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "opening_book_exit",
    "text": "熟悉的路走完了。现在，每一步都算你的。",
    "file": "lia_opening_book_exit_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_opening_book_exit_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "opening_book_exit",
    "text": "理论结束。欢迎来到没有标答的地方。",
    "file": "lia_opening_book_exit_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_opening_book_exit_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "opening_book_exit",
    "text": "前面是准备，后面是棋力。",
    "file": "lia_opening_book_exit_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_accurate_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_accurate",
    "text": "很准。你没有给局面留下多余的噪音。",
    "file": "lia_player_accurate_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_accurate_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_accurate",
    "text": "这一步干净，像把门轻轻关上。",
    "file": "lia_player_accurate_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_accurate_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_accurate",
    "text": "几个候选里，你拿到了最稳的那个。",
    "file": "lia_player_accurate_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_accurate_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_accurate",
    "text": "没有炫技，只有准确。这样的棋最难对付。",
    "file": "lia_player_accurate_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_best_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_best",
    "text": "这就是答案。你找得比我想象中快。",
    "file": "lia_player_best_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_best_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_best",
    "text": "漂亮，局面最窄的门，被你正好推开。",
    "file": "lia_player_best_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_best_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_best",
    "text": "这一手有分量。我得认真回应了。",
    "file": "lia_player_best_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_best_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_best",
    "text": "好棋。不是因为好看，是因为它真的解决了问题。",
    "file": "lia_player_best_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_brilliant_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_brilliant",
    "text": "这一下，漂亮得有点过分。",
    "file": "lia_player_brilliant_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_brilliant_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_brilliant",
    "text": "你把一枚子放上祭坛，换来了整盘的主动。",
    "file": "lia_player_brilliant_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_brilliant_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_brilliant",
    "text": "好大胆。更难得的是，它是对的。",
    "file": "lia_player_brilliant_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_brilliant_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_brilliant",
    "text": "这不是送子，是把棋盘的秩序重新洗牌。",
    "file": "lia_player_brilliant_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_minor_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_minor",
    "text": "轻子落下。这个交换可不轻。",
    "file": "lia_capture_minor_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_minor_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_minor",
    "text": "防线少了一根骨头。",
    "file": "lia_capture_minor_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_minor_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_minor",
    "text": "这一枚不是路过，是被我准确拿走。",
    "file": "lia_capture_minor_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_minor_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_minor",
    "text": "少了一个轻子，接下来的每条线都会更窄。",
    "file": "lia_capture_minor_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_rook_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_rook",
    "text": "车倒下，开放线归我了。",
    "file": "lia_capture_rook_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_rook_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_rook",
    "text": "重子离场，局面的声音突然变大。",
    "file": "lia_capture_rook_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_rook_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_rook",
    "text": "这一车很值钱，我收得相当满意。",
    "file": "lia_capture_rook_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_rook_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_rook",
    "text": "车没了。现在，谁来守住那条线？",
    "file": "lia_capture_rook_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_queen_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_queen",
    "text": "后没了，这下可不是小问题。",
    "file": "lia_capture_queen_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_queen_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_queen",
    "text": "我拿走你的后，棋盘突然安静了。",
    "file": "lia_capture_queen_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_queen_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_queen",
    "text": "这么贵重的礼物，叫我怎么拒绝？",
    "file": "lia_capture_queen_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_queen_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_queen",
    "text": "后落袋。接下来请把残局下得体面些。",
    "file": "lia_capture_queen_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_minor_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_minor",
    "text": "我的轻子没了。很好，你终于盯到了它。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_minor_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_minor_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_minor",
    "text": "这一口吃得漂亮，我需要换一套计划。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_minor_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_minor_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_minor",
    "text": "一枚轻子而已？不，这里会留下回声。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_minor_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_minor_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_minor",
    "text": "你拿得很准，局面换了重量。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_minor_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_rook_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_rook",
    "text": "车被你收走了。这个代价，我记住了。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_rook_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_rook_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_rook",
    "text": "重子离场，看来我得重新谈条件。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_rook_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_queen_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_queen",
    "text": "我的后……好吧，这确实值得庆祝。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_queen_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_queen_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_queen",
    "text": "后被你拿走。终于轮到我承认局面变了。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_queen_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_fork_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_fork",
    "text": "一叉两吃。两件东西，只能保一件。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_fork_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_fork_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_fork",
    "text": "这一跳很坏，两个目标同时收到通知。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_fork_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ],
    "pieces": [
      "n"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_fork_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_fork",
    "text": "马把局面分成了两半，你算得很清楚。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_fork_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ],
    "pieces": [
      "n"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_fork_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_fork",
    "text": "漂亮的双捉。现在轮到你挑一件留下。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_fork_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_pin_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_pin",
    "text": "牵住了。前面的子一动，后面的麻烦就会露出来。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_pin_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_pin_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_pin",
    "text": "这条线把它钉住了，呼吸都得小心。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_pin_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_pin_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_pin",
    "text": "别急着动那枚子，它身后站着更贵的东西。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_pin_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_pin_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_pin",
    "text": "牵制成立。局面开始替你施压。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_pin_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_sacrifice_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_sacrifice",
    "text": "弃子？不，你是在买时间。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_sacrifice_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_sacrifice_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_sacrifice",
    "text": "你交出物质，换回了主动权。很有胆量。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_sacrifice_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_sacrifice_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_sacrifice",
    "text": "这枚子不是丢的，是被你用来开门的。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_sacrifice_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_sacrifice_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_sacrifice",
    "text": "我喜欢这个代价。它换来的东西更值钱。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_sacrifice_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_missed_mate_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "missed_mate",
    "text": "等等，这里本来有将杀。你把结尾放走了。",
    "file": "lia_missed_mate_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_missed_mate_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "missed_mate",
    "text": "胜负的门开过一次，可惜你没有进去。",
    "file": "lia_missed_mate_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_blunder_into_mate_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "blunder_into_mate",
    "text": "这一步，直接走进了结局。",
    "file": "lia_blunder_into_mate_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_blunder_into_mate_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "blunder_into_mate",
    "text": "王自己走进了最后一扇门。",
    "file": "lia_blunder_into_mate_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_mate_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "mate",
    "text": "将杀。王没有下一句了。",
    "file": "lia_mate_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_mate_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "mate",
    "text": "结束。所有出口都已经关上。",
    "file": "lia_mate_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_comeback_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "comeback",
    "text": "还没结束。你刚刚把棋盘拉回来了。",
    "file": "lia_comeback_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_comeback_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "comeback",
    "text": "这口气接得漂亮，劣势没有继续扩大。",
    "file": "lia_comeback_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_brilliant_05",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_brilliant",
    "text": "我得承认，这一手让我笑不出来了。",
    "file": "lia_player_brilliant_05.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_lia_best_move_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "lia_best_move",
    "text": "轮到我了。这个答案，我不会放过。",
    "file": "lia_lia_best_move_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_lia_best_move_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "lia_best_move",
    "text": "看见了吗？最有力的那条路，通常不吵。",
    "file": "lia_lia_best_move_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_lia_best_move_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "lia_best_move",
    "text": "这一手不华丽，但它把几扇门都锁上了。",
    "file": "lia_lia_best_move_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_lia_best_move_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "lia_best_move",
    "text": "压力回来了。现在请你找出同样准确的回应。",
    "file": "lia_lia_best_move_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_pawn_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_pawn",
    "text": "一兵落袋，别小看这种小账。",
    "file": "lia_capture_pawn_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_pawn_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_pawn",
    "text": "小小一口，先把节奏咬住。",
    "file": "lia_capture_pawn_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_pawn_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_pawn",
    "text": "这枚兵的位置太松了，我替你收拾。",
    "file": "lia_capture_pawn_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_capture_pawn_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "capture_pawn",
    "text": "少一兵，故事还长；但账已经记下。",
    "file": "lia_capture_pawn_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_rook_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_rook",
    "text": "你拿得很准，偏偏是最不该丢的那枚。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_rook_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_rook_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_rook",
    "text": "这笔交换不便宜。你赢得很实在。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_rook_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_queen_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_queen",
    "text": "这一口太重，我要把棋盘重新拼起来。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_queen_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_loses_queen_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_loses_queen",
    "text": "你抓住了后。漂亮，别让这份礼物白拿。",
    "file": "lia_player_loses_queen_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_discovered_attack_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_discovered_attack",
    "text": "你把前面的子移开，后面的线终于开口了。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_discovered_attack_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_discovered_attack_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_discovered_attack",
    "text": "一道暗线醒了。棋盘比刚才锋利。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_discovered_attack_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_discovered_attack_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_discovered_attack",
    "text": "这不是移动，是揭幕。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_discovered_attack_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_discovered_attack_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_discovered_attack",
    "text": "后手的威胁，现在露面了。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_discovered_attack_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_zwischenzug_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_zwischenzug",
    "text": "先别急着换。你在中间塞进了一句更重要的话。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_zwischenzug_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_zwischenzug_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_zwischenzug",
    "text": "这一下很细。真正的顺序，被你看见了。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_zwischenzug_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_zwischenzug_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_zwischenzug",
    "text": "交换可以等，威胁不能。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_zwischenzug_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_tactic_zwischenzug_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "tactic_zwischenzug",
    "text": "好的中间手，常常只差这一拍。",
    "file": "lia_tactic_zwischenzug_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_key_threat_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "key_threat",
    "text": "我已经把问题摆到你面前了。",
    "file": "lia_key_threat_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_key_threat_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "key_threat",
    "text": "这不是普通的威胁，下一拍会更难看。",
    "file": "lia_key_threat_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_key_threat_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "key_threat",
    "text": "看清楚，棋盘上有一处正在倒计时。",
    "file": "lia_key_threat_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_key_threat_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "key_threat",
    "text": "现在轮到你决定，守哪一边。",
    "file": "lia_key_threat_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_check_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "check",
    "text": "将军。请把注意力收回来。",
    "file": "lia_check_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_check_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "check",
    "text": "王被叫住了，计划先暂停。",
    "file": "lia_check_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_check_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "check",
    "text": "这不是提醒，是必须回答的问题。",
    "file": "lia_check_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_check_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "check",
    "text": "将军落下，棋盘只给你几秒钟的选择。",
    "file": "lia_check_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_check_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_check",
    "text": "将军收到。很好，现在看你的后续。",
    "file": "lia_player_check_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_check_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_check",
    "text": "这一声有分量，我先处理王的安全。",
    "file": "lia_player_check_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_check_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_check",
    "text": "你把问题递过来了，我会原样还回去。",
    "file": "lia_player_check_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_check_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_check",
    "text": "王被你叫住一会儿，棋局还没有改判。",
    "file": "lia_player_check_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_missed_mate_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "missed_mate",
    "text": "这一刻少了一拍，最锋利的刀就钝了。",
    "file": "lia_missed_mate_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_missed_mate_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "missed_mate",
    "text": "杀棋擦肩而过。别让它影响你的下一步。",
    "file": "lia_missed_mate_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_blunder_into_mate_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "blunder_into_mate",
    "text": "没有回头路了。这个漏洞太深。",
    "file": "lia_blunder_into_mate_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_blunder_into_mate_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "blunder_into_mate",
    "text": "将杀已经写在这里，你只是替它落了笔。",
    "file": "lia_blunder_into_mate_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_mate_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "mate",
    "text": "这一幕到这里，确实没有续集。",
    "file": "lia_mate_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_mate_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "mate",
    "text": "将杀。你把最后一道门也关上了。",
    "file": "lia_mate_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_castling_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "castling",
    "text": "王先安顿，车再说话。",
    "file": "lia_castling_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_castling_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "castling",
    "text": "易位完成。安全感和进攻线一起到位。",
    "file": "lia_castling_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_castling_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "castling",
    "text": "这次搬家很及时，王终于有了位置。",
    "file": "lia_castling_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_castling_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "castling",
    "text": "王车换位，下一幕可以开始了。",
    "file": "lia_castling_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_promotion_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "promotion",
    "text": "升变。小兵终于拿到它应得的名字。",
    "file": "lia_promotion_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_promotion_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "promotion",
    "text": "走到尽头，棋子换了身份，威胁也换了形状。",
    "file": "lia_promotion_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_promotion_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "promotion",
    "text": "新子登场。残局突然不再谦虚。",
    "file": "lia_promotion_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_promotion_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "promotion",
    "text": "升变完成。别眨眼，局面已经换频道。",
    "file": "lia_promotion_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_queen_early_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "queen_early",
    "text": "后出得很早。希望你已经替它安排好回程。",
    "file": "lia_queen_early_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_queen_early_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "queen_early",
    "text": "别急着让后单独工作，它会被棋盘追问。",
    "file": "lia_queen_early_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_queen_early_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "queen_early",
    "text": "贵客提前登场，可惜全场都在盯着它。",
    "file": "lia_queen_early_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_queen_early_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "queen_early",
    "text": "出后太早，节奏先交了一半。",
    "file": "lia_queen_early_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_defense_found_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "defense_found",
    "text": "守住了。你没有被第一眼的威胁骗走。",
    "file": "lia_defense_found_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_defense_found_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "defense_found",
    "text": "好防守，最危险的地方被你封住了。",
    "file": "lia_defense_found_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_defense_found_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "defense_found",
    "text": "这一手不抢戏，却救了整盘棋。",
    "file": "lia_defense_found_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_defense_found_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "defense_found",
    "text": "你找到了唯一不崩的办法。",
    "file": "lia_defense_found_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_missed_tactic_01",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_missed_tactic",
    "text": "机会来过，只是停得太短。",
    "file": "lia_player_missed_tactic_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_missed_tactic_02",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_missed_tactic",
    "text": "这条线本来可以更锋利。",
    "file": "lia_player_missed_tactic_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_missed_tactic_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_missed_tactic",
    "text": "你看见了棋子，没看见它们之间的关系。",
    "file": "lia_player_missed_tactic_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_player_missed_tactic_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "player_missed_tactic",
    "text": "好的战术不会一直等人，下一次要快半拍。",
    "file": "lia_player_missed_tactic_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_comeback_03",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "comeback",
    "text": "绝境里找到这一步，难得。现在重新开始。",
    "file": "lia_comeback_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lia_comeback_04",
    "role": "lia",
    "coachIndex": 0,
    "category": "comeback",
    "text": "局面翻回来了。别浪费第二次机会。",
    "file": "lia_comeback_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  }
]
